Nucleus Co-op

Background streaming and co-op (rust/core/session/src/nucleus/, rust/windows/io/src/nucleus/)
launch games through Nucleus Co-op (https://github.com/SplitScreen-Me/splitscreenme-nucleus)
by SplitScreen.Me, GPL-3.0 licensed, which includes ProtoInput by Ilyaki, MIT
licensed. Rubylight neither bundles nor downloads them: the user downloads
