WebRTC's AEC3 through sonora 0.2.0 (https://github.com/dignifiedquire/sonora), a Rust port
of WebRTC audio processing. Copyright (c) 2011, The WebRTC Project Authors; Copyright (c)
2016, Arun Raghavan and contributors; Copyright (c) 2026, dignifiedquire. BSD 3-Clause; the
full notice ships in the app as client/app/src/main/assets/NOTICE-SONORA.txt.

