Resolution 1 (https://github.com/SnapdragonGameStudios/snapdragon-gsr, commit d926f074,
sgsr/v1/include/glsl/sgsr1_shader_mobile.frag). Copyright (c) 2025, Qualcomm Innovation Center,
Inc.; Copyright (c) 2023, Qualcomm Innovation Center, Inc. BSD-3-Clause; the full notice ships
in the app as client/app/src/main/assets/NOTICE-SGSR1.txt. It ships in:
- Android MediaCodec path: client/app/src/main/assets/shaders/sgsr.frag;
- Android PyroWave renderer: client/app/src/main/jni/pyrowave-renderer/shaders/sgsr.frag and its
  SPIR-V in shaders_spv.h;
- desktop: client/protocol/desktop-media/src/upscale.hlsl, src/upscale.spv and src/metal/upscale.metal.

libvirtualgamepad (rubylight-vgamepad and rubylight-vgamepad-proto)

Rubylight's first-party UMDF2 VHF virtual gamepad driver and its shared protocol/profile
library adapt Nonary/libvirtualgamepad (https://github.com/Nonary/libvirtualgamepad, commit
93dc007, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Chase Payne; Steam Controller 2026 profile from
jlobue10 in PR #6), with MIT notices in third-party/licenses/libvirtualgamepad-LICENSE.txt
and rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad/LICENSE-MIT:
- Protocol, wire ABI and GUID/slot/lifecycle state machine (from include/libvirtualgamepad/protocol.h
  and driver/src/driver.cpp): rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad-proto/src/protocol.rs and
  rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad-proto/src/lifecycle.rs.
- Input report pacing pump and Steam Controller haptic/settings rings (from
  driver/src/report_pump.{h,cpp} and driver/src/steam_haptic_queue.h):
  rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad-proto/src/report_pump.rs and steam_haptic_queue.rs.
- HID/PID profiles, descriptors, reports, motion/touch/battery encoding and force-feedback engine
  (from driver/src/{profile,xbox_one,xbox_series,dualshock4,dualsense,switch_pro,steam_controller,
  pid_ff}.{h,cpp} and include/libvirtualgamepad/{ds4_usb,ds5_usb,sc26_usb}.h):
  rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad-proto/src/profiles/{mod,generic,xbox_one,xbox_series,dualshock4,
  dualsense,switch_pro,steam_controller,pid_ff}.rs.
- UMDF 2 VHF source driver entrypoint, PnP/Power callbacks, local I/O target, Configuration
  Manager child check, PID periodic timer, SC26 high-resolution keepalive worker and INF
  (from driver/src/driver.cpp and driver/VibeshineVhfGamepad.inf.in):
  rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad/driver/src/{lib,wdf,vhf,keepalive,device,entry}.rs and
  rust/drivers/rubylight-vgamepad/rubylight_vgamepad.inx.
